# 05-SET / store and domain setup

**Goes here.** Nothing to a live store. Domain and email, store configuration,
payments and tax settings, shipping profiles, tracking install, legal pages, and the
verification step that proves each one worked.

## Not here

- Whether the numbers a tool reports are correct -> 06-MEA
- Which tax registrations you need and how remittance works -> 20-FIN
- Ongoing page performance -> 08-SPD
- Customer experience, delight and service -> 17-CXP
- Bot protection at checkout -> 23-SEC

SET installs it. MEA verifies it. FIN decides what the obligation is. CXP decides
what the customer experiences once the store is live.

**Lesson from misfiles.** 3 customer experience essays were filed here. "Experience"
is not "setup". If the source is about how a customer feels, it is 17-CXP.

